GTM Experiment #1: We Posted on LinkedIn Every Day for 30 Days. Here's the Data.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Arjun runs a B2B SaaS company out of Bangalore — HR automation tools for mid-size Indian companies. He had 1,100 LinkedIn followers, was posting maybe twice a month, and getting almost nothing from it. His hypothesis going in: \\\\\\\"If I post every single day for a month, I should be able to generate at least 5 meaningful business conversations.\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"He used Gravity to handle the content. Here's exactly what happened.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Setup\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Gravity ingested Arjun's website, scraped 3 competitor profiles, and built a 30-day content calendar. The post mix was:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**14 posts**: Thought leadership and opinion pieces about HR in India\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**8 posts**: Tactical how-tos (\\\\\\\"how to reduce employee onboarding time from 3 weeks to 3 days\\\\\\\")\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**5 posts**: Founder story and behind-the-scenes content\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**3 posts**: Data and stats posts (original research snippets)\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"20\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"21\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Posting time was set to 8:30 AM IST every day — the window when Arjun's target audience (HR heads and ops leads) was most active according to LinkedIn analytics.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"22\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"23\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Week 1 Results\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"24\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"25\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The first week was underwhelming. Honestly.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"26\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"35\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"36\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The two DMs were both from recruiters. The algorithm was still warming up to the new posting cadence. Nothing converted. Arjun nearly gave up here.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"37\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"38\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Week 2 Results\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"39\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"40\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Week 2 picked up slightly. One post — a personal story about firing his first employee — got 3x the engagement of anything in week 1.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"41\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"50\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"51\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Two of those DMs were from HR directors at companies with 200+ employees. Neither converted immediately, but they were the first real business conversations.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"52\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"53\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Week 3 Results\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"54\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"55\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The compound effect started showing. Older posts were still getting discovered. New followers from week 2 were engaging with fresh content.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"56\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"65\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"66\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A tactical post on \\\\\\\"why Indian companies are still using Excel for payroll in 2026\\\\\\\" got picked up and shared by a popular HR newsletter. That single post drove 6,200 impressions on its own.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"67\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"68\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Week 4 Results\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"69\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"70\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The final week was the best. But not for the reasons Arjun expected.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"71\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"80\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"81\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Total across 30 days: **58,300 impressions, 860 likes, 182 comments, 36 DMs, 226 new followers.**\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"82\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"83\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Key Findings\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"84\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"85\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Consistency beats virality.** The viral payroll post drove a spike but not the conversions. The 14 warm DMs that actually turned into conversations came from people who had seen Arjun's name across 3–4 posts over multiple weeks and finally reached out.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"86\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Tactical content outperforms opinion content** for Arjun's ICP. Posts with \\\\\\\"how to\\\\\\\" headlines got 2.3x more profile clicks than generic takes.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"87\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Week 1 is the price of admission.** Every founder who quits LinkedIn after two weeks of low engagement is quitting right before the algorithm starts pushing their content.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"88\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Comments drive reach more than likes.** Posts that got 5+ comments consistently hit 2–3x more impressions than posts with 30 likes and 2 comments.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"89\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"90\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Twist\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"91\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"92\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Here's the part nobody talks about. The post that generated the most business — two inbound demo calls and one direct ₹2.4L deal — wasn't one of the high-engagement posts. It was a quiet, 180-impression post about a niche feature of Arjun's product. Someone who was actively searching for that exact solution saw it, went to his profile, read 6 more posts, and sent a DM.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"93\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"94\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The viral posts built the audience. The niche posts closed the business.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"95\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"96\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Conclusion\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"97\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"98\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"30 days of daily LinkedIn content, run entirely by Gravity, resulted in 226 new followers, 36 DMs, and 3 business conversations that generated over ₹3L in pipeline. Arjun's time investment: 20 minutes per week reviewing and approving Gravity's draft queue.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"99\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"100\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"That's the experiment. Now you know what to expect.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"101\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"102\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"103\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Key Takeaways\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"104\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"105\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Daily posting compounds — week 4 impressions were 6x higher than week 1\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"106\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Warm DMs come from repeated visibility, not single viral posts\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"107\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Niche content converts; broad content attracts\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"108\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The algorithm rewards consistency over cleverness\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"109\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"110\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"111\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 italic my-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Want Gravity to run your 30-day LinkedIn experiment? [Start your free 7-day trial →](/)\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"112\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Le\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-8 bg-brand-gold-pale dark:bg-brand-gold/8 border border-brand-gold/20 dark:border-brand-gold/15 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Ready to automate your GTM?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,